{"seq":3,"slug":"multivariate","title":"多元：把 KDE 推到高维，然后撞上一堵墙","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/kernel-density-estimation/multivariate","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"multivariate-kde","title":"多元 KDE：从标量带宽到带宽矩阵","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/kernel-density-estimation/multivariate/multivariate-kde","wordCount":1356,"readingTime":6},{"seq":2,"slug":"curse-dimensionality","title":"维度诅咒：KDE 在高维为什么注定失效","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/kernel-density-estimation/multivariate/curse-dimensionality","wordCount":1466,"readingTime":6},{"seq":3,"slug":"adaptive-kde","title":"自适应带宽：稠密处精细，稀疏处平滑","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/kernel-density-estimation/multivariate/adaptive-kde","wordCount":1461,"readingTime":6}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"多元-把-kde-推到高维-然后撞上一堵墙\">多元：把 KDE 推到高维，然后撞上一堵墙</h1><p>一维 KDE 干净利落，可现实数据往往是多维的。这一章讲清楚把 KDE 抬到多维会发生什么，以及为什么高维是 KDE 最大的软肋。</p>\n<p>第一篇 <a href=\"multivariate-kde\">多元 KDE</a> 给出推广形式：把标量带宽换成带宽矩阵 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span></span></span></span></span>，核变成多元核（最常用乘积核或多元高斯核），并讨论 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span></span></span></span></span> 的三种参数化——各向同性、对角、满矩阵——各自的取舍。这是形式上的直接延伸。</p>\n<p>第二篇 <a href=\"curse-dimensionality\">维度诅咒</a> 揭示坏消息：KDE 的收敛速率随维度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span> 迅速退化，从一维的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>n</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>5</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n^{-4/5}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.888em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.888em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">4/5</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 掉到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span> 维的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>n</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n^{-4/(4+d)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.888em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.888em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">4/</span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，要维持同样的估计精度，样本量需求随维度指数级膨胀。这条数学事实决定了纯 KDE 在超过五六维时基本失效。</p>\n<p>第三篇 <a href=\"adaptive-kde\">自适应带宽</a> 是对固定带宽局限的回应：在数据稠密处用小带宽保留细节、在稀疏尾部用大带宽压噪声，Abramson 的平方根律与 balloon/sample-point 两类估计量是主要方案，对多峰与重尾分布尤其有效。</p>\n<p>这一章承接基础与核带宽两章的所有概念，并直接把「维度诅咒」这个动机交给下一章的快速计算与实践。读完你会明白：高维下别硬用 KDE，或至少先降维、再自适应。</p>\n"}